  "promptTemplate": "A field of {{flock_count}} digital sheep moving at {{sheep_speed}} speed, driven by a {{wash_intensity}} wash. The flock shows {{sheep_creativity}} creativity, born in a {{sheep_born}} setting, and lives a {{sheep_life_span}} lifespan. They interact as {{sheep_need_eachother}} with {{sheep_independence}} independence, {{sheep_agree}} alignment, {{sheep_stubbornness}} stubbornness, and {{sheep_ambition}} ambition. Wolves exhibit {{wolf_stubbornness}} stubbornness, against a color palette defined by a {{hue_band}} hue band and {{hue_offset}} offset. This is edition {{edition}}.",
